{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23258","headline":"岁暮枉衢州张使君书并诗因以长句报之 · 白居易","name":"岁暮枉衢州张使君书并诗因以长句报之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西州彼此意何如，官职蹉跎岁欲除。\n浮石潭边停五马，望涛楼上得双鱼。\n万言旧手才难敌，五字新题思有余。\n贫薄诗家无好物，反投桃李报琼琚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}